Zlib: gzip and deflate files and output compression, with the zlib of
the base system.

The module zlib of PHP 8.3 for php83 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20230831/zlib.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php83/conf.d, its headers in
include/php83/php/ext/zlib.
